              "value": "Drink Flesh"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(divine, necromancy)\n\nThe totenmaske drains flesh from the creature's body. The creature becomes sickened 2 and drained 1 unless it succeeds at a DC 25 Fortitude save (sickened 2 and drained 2 on a critical failure)."
            },
